    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Lore Knowledge.</strong> Choose one of the following skills: Arcana, History, Investigation, Nature, or Religion. If you lack proficiency in the chosen skill, you gain proficiency in it, and if you already have proficiency in it, you gain Expertise in it.</p><p><strong>Quick Study.</strong> You can take the Study action as a Bonus Action.</p>",
